          "text": "A quadratic equation has the form ax^2 + bx + c = 0 with a ≠ 0. Its discriminant is D = b^2 - 4ac. For real coefficients, D > 0 gives two distinct real roots, D = 0 gives equal real roots, and D < 0 gives a complex-conjugate pair.",
